ianti_auto":"新垣平","people_xingming":"新垣平","start_index":21,"tongjian_id":"8f05ac7f-db0e-11ef-bbf1-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"渭陽","place_name_jianti_auto":"渭阳","resolved_place_entity_id":2473,"start_index":12,"tongjian_id":"8f05ac80-db0e-11ef-8c03-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"五帝廟","place_name_jianti_auto":"五帝庙","resolved_place_entity_id":4244,"start_index":14,"tongjian_id":"8f05ac81-db0e-11ef-8781-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"長門","place_name_jianti_auto":"长门","resolved_place_entity_id":4126,"start_index":60,"tongjian_id":"8f05ac84-db0e-11ef-8b2b-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"五帝壇","place_name_jianti_auto":"五帝坛","resolved_place_entity_id":1322,"start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"8f05ac85-db0e-11ef-805b-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[{"display_title":"读史方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","excerpts":[{"context_after":"景帝时，窦太主献长门园，武帝改为宫。如淳曰：长门者，因长...","context_before":"...宫，在府东北。《括地志》：汉长门故亭，在万年县东北苑中。","source_end_index":148,"source_paragraph_tongjian_id":"54298379-c9a2-5539-ae10-4b1c5d1c773d","source_start_index":132,"source_text":"文帝十六年，于长门道北立五帝坛。"}],"path":"陕西方舆纪要/一、西安府（卷五十三）","source_name":"读史方舆纪要"}],"class_tags":["内政","人事"],"content":"1夏，四月，上郊祀五帝于渭陽五帝廟。於是貴新垣平至上大夫，賜累千金；而使博士、諸生刺六經中作王制，謀議巡狩、封禪事。又於長門道北立五帝壇。","content_fanyi":"夏季，四月，汉文帝刘恒在渭阳五帝庙郊祭五帝。此时，他宠信新垣平，将他提升为上大夫，赏赐黄金累计达一千斤；又让博士、诸生采辑六经中的记载，编成《王制》，商议巡狩、封禅等事宜；又在长门亭道路北面设立五帝坛。","content_jianti_auto":"1夏，四月，上郊祀五帝于渭阳五帝庙。于是贵新垣平至上大夫，赐累千金；而使博士、诸生刺六经中作王制，谋议巡狩、封禅事。又于长门道北立五帝坛。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":1200,"number":1,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":0,"tongjian_id":"8f05ac6e-db0e-11ef-84d9-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"pe